        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA-Rated 2-Bedroom End-of-Terrace Home Baker Hall, Navan\n\nWell-presented two-bedroom end-of-terrace property available to rent in the popular Baker Hall development in Navan. \n\nThis bright and comfortable home offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout and is ideally suited to tenants looking for a modern home in a convenient residential location.\n\nThe ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hall, spacious living room, kitchen/dining area with access to the private rear garden, and a separate guest WC.\nUpstairs, there are two good-sized bedrooms, including a master bedroom with en-suite, along with a separate bathroom.\n\nThere is one allocated parking space and an additional space for guest parking.\n\nBaker Hall is conveniently located close to Navan town centre, with shops, schools, restaurants and a range of local amenities nearby. The property also offers easy access to transport links and the M3 motorway.\n\n\"Enquiries via the contact link only\""
